  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HRFT- Fight against torture and gross human rights violations for rights- based regime</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to contribute ensuring that those who have been subjected to gross and serious human rights violations, especially torture and other ill-treatment, have access to the right to remedy and reparation; the prevention of human rights violations, including torture and promoting fundamental freedoms</narrative>
  </description>
